    "aspectRules": {
      "9:16": "The 9:16 map is a set of anchors, not stretch boxes. Images fill their box with cover; text auto-fits inside; rules align to the lower edge of their box, inset 0.01, keep 1.5-2 px thickness and never cross text; nested shapes keep their 16:9 relative inset (0.04 for the sun core, 0.06 for the sticker on its torn bed, 0.03 for corner marks). Never stretch a 16:9 composition."
    }
